WEBVTT

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.700
"November 9, 2002"

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.450
"56th All-Japan
Artistic Gymnastics Championships"

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.370
It's the same hairstyle, isn't it?!

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:56.410
Hm?

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.870
Oh, it was my daughter's idea. How is it?

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.410
Huh? Uh... um... it looks goo--

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.910
I was told it doesn't look good.
I'll change it back tomorrow.

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.040
No matter what you do, if it's bad, it's bad.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.950
It's the same with Japan's gymnastic world...

00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:17.830
Ever since the team gold
in Montreal 25 years ago,

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:20.040
we haven't achieved any results,

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.540
so it can't be helped
that no one cares about us.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.700
When you won your individual medals,

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:33.540
everyone made a big deal about
your hair and called you "Samurai,"

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.450
"Once again... Samurai Aragaki's Noble Death"
"Aragaki Misfires"

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.450
everyone made a big deal about
your hair and called you "Samurai,"

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.870
"Once again... Samurai Aragaki's Noble Death"
"Aragaki Misfires"

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:37.870
but now this is how they treat you.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:39.450
If I did my hair like yours--!

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:41.910
No, that's not the problem.

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:42.910
No--

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.580
Y-You're right...

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.750
Not getting any results was
the coaches' responsibility.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.500
In order for a new coaching policy to work,

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.790
we would start with the next
generation of young athletes...

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:55.500
I do feel badly about your generation.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:58.080
I can make up for it with practice!

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.290
Huh?

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.290
Let's stop this.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.250
You're right! Then, let's figure out
a training plan for the next--

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.620
That's not what I meant.

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:10.950
Your shoulder hurts, right?

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.040
Yeah...

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:15.700
Even if you keep pushing yourself
to compete despite that injury,

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.870
you won't be able to win.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:19.040
Huh...?

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.580
Retire, Jotaro.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.750
What?!

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.790
You of all people should feel
the limit of your body--

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.910
U-Um, uh, wait, uh...

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.200
Go ahead. Pick up.

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:35.160
It's Dad.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.410
Oh, it's me, Rei.

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:37.910
We're out of milk.

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:39.500
You'll want some, right?

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.580
I'll pick some up.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.620
That's all. Bye!

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.120
Bye.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.160
She said we're out of milk.

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.910
In your current state, nothing will
come of clinging onto your career.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:58.790
You'll definitely regret it,
and you'll make your family sad.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:02.500
From now on, think about Rei,
and prioritize her over gymnastics.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.910
You're not cut out to be a coach.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.910
Think about what you want to do
as your second career.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:11.620
But this retirement is so out of the blue...

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.040
I've been saying this for years.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.370
Huh?

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.080
Jotaro, you need to think about
what you'll do with yourself now.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.000
You're right!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.660
I'll move my body more and more!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:23.080
It's about time you gave up
your seat to the youngsters.

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:25.450
You're right! My legs and back will get soft!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.000
Don't you think it's time
you took off your uniform?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.790
You're right! I sweat so much!

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.120
Seriously...?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.120
It was also my fault for not correcting you.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.330
I should've been more clear.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:42.410
I'm really sorry!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.160
Retire, huh?

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.250
Retire?

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.040
"Episode 1
'Retiring Samurai'"

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.700
"Episode 1
'Retiring Samurai'"

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.700
Retire...

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.250
"Episode 1
'Retiring Samurai'"

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.330
"Episode 1
'Retiring Samurai'"

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.330
I can't imagine it at all.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.200
What did Mr. Amakusa say?

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:10.000
Next is the NHK Cup, right?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:12.700
Weren't you talking strategy for that?

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.290
Oh, right...

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:18.580
He came up with something
I'd never heard of before.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.040
That's amazing!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:22.790
Here, Bigbird.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:24.660
Thanks!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.660
Retire, Jotaro.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.330
Retire...

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.540
Are you tired?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:46.410
Huh?

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:51.540
You've been in a daze today,
so I thought maybe you were.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:53.540
Is your shoulder okay?

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:58.580
Hm?

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.580
Wanna go see ninjas during your winter break?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.000
Huh?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.700
You don't?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.790
Really?!

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:08.500
--Yay!

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.910
--Yeah!
--Yay!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:34.330
Tomoyo... Amakusa told me to retire...

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:42.790
If I can't take care of Rei
properly as an athlete,

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:45.660
then I'll stop being one.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:59.120
It's the first trip I'll take with Rei
since you passed away.

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.660
I'll tell her then.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:12.750
I thought I could still keep going, though...

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:21.660
It's where you and Mom went
for your honeymoon, right?

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:22.700
Yeah.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.540
But why Kinugawa, anyway?

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.200
Because Edo Wonderland is there?

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.790
There's also the hot springs and the ropeway.

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:30.870
Kinugawa's fun.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:34.290
I wish we could've stayed at the same ryokan.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.750
I can't believe it went under.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.500
"Ninjas & Ninjutsu"

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.040
You really like ninjas, huh?

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.160
I mean, they're <i>so </i>cool!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:46.250
Like in Ooku vs. Kunoichi,
when the ninja Mom played

00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:49.330
dodged the bullets from the
court lady <i>hannya</i>'s machine gun!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:52.160
Those movements were even better than Keanu's!

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.660
But,

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.950
I came to like them after watching you, Dad.

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.250
Gymnasts are like ninjas, you know?

00:07:05.870 --> 00:07:08.830
Hurry up, Dad! Hurry!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.700
If you see someone suspicious,

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.700
point your jutte at them and say this--

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.330
"You're under arrest!"

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.290
Pretend I'm a suspicious person
and practice on me!

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.790
Ready, set--

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.370
You're under arrest!

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:36.250
Ninjas live under the law,

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.250
but at times, a ninja appears
who questions the law,

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.660
--and they leave the village.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:43.200
--The park closes at 4 p.m.
--and they leave the village.

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.910
I'll tell her after this show's over.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:08.580
Found you!

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.580
Huh?

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:14.580
An agent's here!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.000
It's Smith! Smith!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.790
Wait, what?

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.200
Yamakasi!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.700
R-Rei!

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:48.870
Rei!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.580
Hey, Rei!

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:11.620
A ninja!

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.580
Wai--?! Uh...

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.200
Whoa!

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.040
What?!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.450
Nyan-mage!

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:45.250
You're under arrest!

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:50.040
Bravo!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.580
Edo Wonderland sure has changed...

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.830
I totally missed my chance...

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.790
She's gotten so big...

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:26.250
Hey, Rei--

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:27.620
Hm?

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.500
I can't get the words out!

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:31.660
What is it?

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:35.790
Uh, did you have fun in Kinugawa?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.120
Yeah!

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:40.660
I see. Good, good...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.000
We're home!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.870
We're already back home...

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.370
Looks like Grandma's not home.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:53.450
Hm? Yeah...

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.040
We're home, Bigbird!

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.290
Behind you! Who's that?

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.500
Who's that?

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.870
Hm?

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:13.450
Behind?

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.700
If you keep saying weird stuff,
we'll send you back to South America!

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.790
I'll start the washing machine.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.450
It's fine, I'll do it.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:51.410
A-Are you trying to kill me?

00:11:56.000 --> 00:12:00.160
I need to hurry up and
tell her about my retirement.

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:02.540
Dad!

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:06.080
There's a ninja in the bath!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.500
What?!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.540
--Who <i>are </i>you?!
--Told you! Told you!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.620
I am a ninja, indeed.

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:18.370
Dad, isn't this the ninja
that was at Edo Wonderland?

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:20.500
Yes, yes! Edo Wonderland!

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:23.080
Yeah, but who <i>are </i>you?

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.330
I am a fugitive ninja, indeed.

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:28.250
I'm being chased by agents,

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.910
and if they catch me, I'll be made
to go back to my country...

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.620
Huh? That wasn't part of the show?

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:37.200
Who're these "agents" you're
talking about? Who are <i>you</i>?!

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.700
Bigbird, no!

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:44.370
I want to stay in Japan, indeed.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:47.500
Please allow me to remain here.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:49.620
He doesn't seem like a bad guy.

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:52.700
Coming in without permission
makes him a bad guy, doesn't it?

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:55.290
What are you doing?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.330
Grandma!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:58.080
Wh-Who's there?!

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.450
--Grandma! Ninja, ninja, ninja, ninja, ninja!

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.200
--Rei!
--Grandma! Ninja, ninja, ninja, ninja, ninja!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.830
It followed us home from Edo Wonderland!

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:09.660
You're not Japanese, are you?

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:12.370
N-Ninja Art: Dogeza!

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:13.910
You're kidding me.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:18.870
I-I would like to remain here, indeed.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:21.410
I don't want to be deported.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.540
Do what you want.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.040
What?!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.950
You have your reasons, don't you?

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.200
There are tons of guys like this in 'bukuro.

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.330
Not ninjas, though!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:39.330
In Ooku vs. Kunoichi,
ronin helped hide Mom, too!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:43.080
It was fine for your mom! Not for this guy!

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:47.160
I am the one who built this house.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.000
Th-That's true, but...

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.950
I-I am in your debt...

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.040
Thank you very much...!

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.290
With this, I can continue to be a ninja.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:07.950
Is that ninja really going to stay with us?

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:12.120
It's his fault that I missed my chance
to say that I'm retiring again...

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:16.540
You're off today, so you're going
directly to the club, right?

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.660
Rei, you're coming, too.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:19.160
Huh?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.500
I can't leave you alone with that ninja.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.580
Hm? Me?

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:33.250
Oh, it's Rei, yay!

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.830
Takizawa!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:37.580
Jotaro, how was your day off?
It'd been a while, right?

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.910
It was nice and relaxing.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:41.330
We went to Kinugawa!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.410
Seriously?! No. Way.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:46.750
Kinugawa, as in the river where ogres get mad?

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.950
That's crazy!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.160
Did you see any ogres?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.370
Nope!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.000
Seriously?! None?!

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:56.160
Isn't that bad? Even though
the name has "ogre" in it?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.330
But there was a ninja.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.750
No way, a ninja?!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.330
That's amazing!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.500
--Rei.
--But that means it's not Kinugawa anymore!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.700
--But there was one, and now he's at home.
--But that means it's not Kinugawa anymore!

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:04.910
--But there was one, and now he's at home.
--Is it "Ninnugawa"?

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.450
--"Ninnu"... "Ninugawa"?

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:08.410
--I'm going to go talk to Amakusa for a second.
--"Ninnu"... "Ninugawa"?

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:10.830
Can you take care of the warmup?

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:12.700
No prob!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.540
You haven't said anything yet?!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:17.580
Well, I have in my head, lots of times.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.540
Say it out loud.

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.250
I was unable to...

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.750
We can't move next week's
press conference, you know.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:28.500
If Rei's here today,
then find a chance to talk to her.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.620
--Oooh!
--Wow!

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:35.000
It's so precise!

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.000
Wow!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.000
How do you get it so straight?

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.540
If you squeeze here like this,
it goes "whoosh" and that's it.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.000
I don't get it at all!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.290
Hey, do another one!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.080
Oh, today...

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:49.040
Hey, kiddos!

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.700
You know Jotaro's injured, don't ya?

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.040
Don't bug him, yo!

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:55.660
But--

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:58.750
Then, when can we see it again?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.080
Jotaro?

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.790
Actually, I'm going to ret--

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.620
Hey, Joe!

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:42.660
I'm here to assist you, indeed!

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:45.160
You! Why are you here?!

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.200
You followed us again?

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.080
Rei! Ninugawa!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.540
There's a Ninugawa in 'bukuro, too!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.870
"Ninke"... "Nikebukuro"!

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:55.580
--A ninja?
--Why's there a ninja here?

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:58.040
H-Hey...

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:00.410
Now, here I go.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.790
Huh?

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:14.450
Hey! Wait, you--

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.950
Wow!

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:24.910
Wow!

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.330
This ninja's good!

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.620
Now what's he doing?!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.950
"Change in the changing room!"
"Keep it neat"

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:09.830
"Men's Changing Room"

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.830
"Men's Changing Room"

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.830
Well? Wasn't I amazing?

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.660
I could do a lot, right?

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:15.950
What's your deal? Following me
around since yesterday.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:19.370
I'll assist you anytime, indeed!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:21.870
Because I want to see your gymnastics again!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:25.000
"Again"? You've never even
seen it once, have you?

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.910
--Besides, I'm--
--I...

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.580
...am Leo, indeed.

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:30.910
Leo?

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.910
Yes, Samurai.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:40.330
And now, it's the day of the press conference...

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:44.250
Every time I was going to say something,
that ninja would get in the way.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.870
At least, before I leave the house...

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:51.750
Rei.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:54.950
You look cool.

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.830
Rei. Today, I'm--

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.160
Joe! You look cool, indeed!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.290
Are you going to a party? What kind of party?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.040
So amazing! So cool!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.540
Hey, what kind of party?

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:15.330
BB, quiet.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:20.000
Come on, Mr. Amakusa's waiting for you!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:21.330
W-Wait, Rei.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:22.370
Go on, go on!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.790
--R-Right...
--Come on, come on!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:34.370
It's fine. Go on.

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:37.290
I'm off.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.870
Do your best.

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.910
"Registration"

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.120
"Registration"
"Jotaro Aragaki
Press Conference"

00:19:53.870 --> 00:19:57.080
"Jotaro Aragaki - Press Conference
Announcing Retirement"

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:01.160
Rei, what is Joe going to do, indeed?

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:05.330
Um--

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:17.950
Um, gymnastics has been my life.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:22.080
And I don't know anything but gymnastics.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:28.330
But even someone like me had a wife
I didn't deserve, and we had a daughter.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.910
She's a very good daughter.

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:42.620
My daughter told me once that
she liked watching me do gymnastics.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:49.120
Even after I had a family, I feel like
I was supported by gymnastics.

00:20:49.120 --> 00:20:54.910
And so, I've lived until today as a gymnast.

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:59.200
But at this time, I have made a decision--

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:07.950
Today, I, Jotaro Aragaki, will retir--

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.660
...will retire not.

00:21:35.660 --> 00:21:37.700
"Not"?

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:39.000
Not?

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:44.910
I will retire not.

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:15.910
"The Gymnastics Samurai"
